  "solution": {
    "text": "Charge separation reduces the stability of the resonating structures. If charge separation exists, the structure with opposite charges closer is more stable. So, <math> <mtext>i</mtext></math>is most stable followed by <math> <mrow>  <mtext>ii</mtext></mrow></math>and <math > <mrow>  <mtext>iii</mtext></mrow></math>",
